171875, -0.020721435546875, 0.0025424957275390625, -0.0166168212890625, 0.04559326171875, -0.01094818115234375, 0.03515625, -0.0273590087890625, -0.03900146484375, 0.00743865966796875, -0.006839752197265625, 0.0355224609375, -0.00713348388671875, -0.056365966796875, 0.0031986236572265625, 0.02197265625, 0.044921875, 0.018524169921875, -0.048126220703125, 0.01085662841796875, -0.004024505615234375, -0.039947509765625, -0.01617431640625, -0.0328369140625, 0.0565185546875, -0.01214599609375, -0.04278564453125, -0.0270233154296875, -0.091796875, -0.021759033203125, -0.052032470703125, -0.0200347900390625, -0.00826263427734375, -0.029998779296875, -0.0027713775634765625, -0.01129150390625, 0.006603240966796875, -0.03802490234375, 0.0501708984375, 0.01387786865234375, -0.0289764404296875, 0.051605224609375, -0.01189422607421875, -0.002227783203125, 0.006488800048828125, -0.016754150390625, -0.0190277099609375, 0.042022705078125, 0.0506591796875, 0.09368896484375, 0.03936767578125, 0.032684326171875, 0.0012960433959960938, 0.0271148681640625, -0.0175628662109375, -0.06451416015625, -0.059844970703125, -0.0220947265625, 0.01453399658203125], `id`: "db05fdad-801c-4f83-9a96-0b9e0f44bd2f", `document_type`: "document", `source_document_id`: 7, `text`: "title: Onboarding/2. Setup, body: ﻿Setup\r\nhorizontal.app\r\nClone the repository from here:\r\nhttps://github.com/horizontal-app-org/horizontal.app.git\r\n\r\n\r\nAPI setup\r\nGo to the api project.\r\n\r\n\r\nIn the .env file everything is set up except secrets and access tokens.\r\n\r\n\r\nFill out the following values:\r\nVariable\r\n\tValue\r\n\tFIREWORKS_API_KEY\r\n\tfw_3ZbY8mdyLqgWz4i9ZqMgPxFy\r\n\tGOOGLE_DRIVE_CLIENT_SECRET\r\n\t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\r\n\tGOOGLE_DRIVE_REFRESH_TOKEN\r\n\t1//04fRsca-Md9F1CgYIARAAGAQSNwF-L9IrJ-N6GiiYMgOKdLcMI_Y-kdbz7cQfc9hr0wonANgtpEInsMODB_OFUoxDfggzgExKgzY\r\n\tGOOGLE_DRIVE_ACCESS_TOKEN\r\n\tya29.A0AS3H6Nz9g02o5IuBX-5DkXIrnY686MLqw0jeq8tvo_W3W3mIdJnbMvJTuVBlvi7bgzXM2el2rGmaggqJ0zAINCHPH2RNR3eiWg9pQgI8cjps6YqAIXcucAc5uO6XvwYvAwQmT1xzM8jRsVuVqQyucvO9rvE3Y7ykFi44F--7oxIVGi1PdbIKvIM95K1fzoWYU3MN2H4aCgYKAU8SARASFQHGX2Mi8puZdz17USqh6DBVzt7qYg0206\r\n\t\r\n\r\nFor the moment, Google Drive has a fixed token for my personal account. Which is okay, you can use that, to quickly set up an integration. In a later doc, we’ll discuss how you can connect your own account.\r\n________________\r\nGraph builder setup\r\nNow go to the graphbuilder project.\r\n\r\n\r\nCopy .env.example to .env and fill out these values:\r\nVariable\r\n\tValue\r\n\tFIREWORKS_API_KEY\r\n\tfw_3ZbY8mdyLqgWz4i9ZqMgPxFy\r\n\t\r\n\r\nEverything else is set up correctly.\r\nStart the project\r\nGo to the root folder and run:\r\ndocker compose up\r\n\r\n\r\nRun the seeder in the api service:\r\n* docker compose exec api php artisan db:seed\r\n\r\n\r\nThe following services should start:\r\n* API at tenant1.localhost:9999\r\n* Graphbuilder at localhost:9998\r\n* Memgraph Lab at localhost:9997\r\n* Postgres at localhost:54320\r\n* Memgraph at localhost:7687\r\n* A few workers        \r\n\r\n\r\nYou can access:\r\n* Postgres with root/root\r\n* Memgraph Lab with horizontal/password the default database is memgraph\r\nStart the indexing process\r\nTo get sample data hit this endpoint in a browser or API client:\r\ntenant1.localhost:9999/api/test\r\n\r\n\r\nNow you can have a coffee because it takes about 15 minutes 😀 It should fully index my Google Drive containing some docs about Horizontal.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you have a problem with the Google Drive integration (it responds that the given folder does not exist) the refresh token is expired. Ping me for a fresh one.\r\nTest the search engine\r\nTo test the search engine hit this endpoint in a browser or API client, first:\r\ntenant1.localhost:9999/api/test/auth/token\r\n\r\n\r\nIt creates an access token that you can use in an API client, etc.\r\n\r\n\r\nTo test the search engine, run this:\r\n\r\n\r\ncurl --request POST \\\r\n  --url http://localhost:9999/api/questions/ask \\\r\n  --header \'Accept: application/json\' \\\r\n  --header \'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_TOKEN>\' \\\r\n  --header \'Content-Type: application/json\' \\\r\n  --header \'User-Agent: insomnia/11.4.0\' \\\r\n  --data \'{\r\n        \"question\": \"tell me everything about horizontal\"\r\n}\'\r\n\r\n\r\nOr run the equivalent request in Postman/Insomnia.", `_node_content`: "{\"id_\": \"db05fdad-801c-4f83-9a96-0b9e0f44bd2f\", \"embedding\": null, \"metadata\": {\"title\": \"Onboarding/2. Setup\", \"source_type\": \"google_drive\", \"source_url\": null, \"document_chunk_id\": 9, \"source_document_id\": 7, \"document_type\": \"document\"}, \"excluded_embed_metadata_keys\": [\"source_url\", \"document_chunk_id\", \"source_document_id\", \"document_type\"], \"excluded_llm_metadata_keys\": [\"source_type\", \"source_url\", \"document_chunk_id\", \"source_document_id\", \"document_type\"], \"relationships\": {\"1\": {\"node_id\": \"d590ce85-850e-48eb-91bc-2409b9930721\", \"node_type\": \"4\", \"metadata\": {\"title\": \"Onboarding/2. Setup\", \"source_type\": \"google_drive\", \"source_url\": null, \"document_chunk_id\": 9, \"source_document_id\": 7, \"document_type\": \"document\"}, \"hash\": \"b89f8cae14e98ac02bdafac5a3e2e16855e2bca8045baa09a0bce403ab1bbbd8\", \"class_name\": \"RelatedNodeInfo\"}}, \"metadata_template\": \"{key}: {value}\", \"metadata_separator\": \"\\n\", \"text\": \"\", \"mimetype\": \"text/plain\", \"start_char_idx\": 0, \"end_char_idx\": 2912, \"metadata_seperator\": \"\\n\", \"text_template\": \"{metadata_str}\\n\\n{content}\", \"class_name\": \"TextNode\"}", `_node_type`: "TextNode", `doc_id`: "d590ce85-850e-48eb-91bc-2409b9930721", `document_chunk_id`: 9, `document_id`: "d590ce85-850e-48eb-91bc-2409b9930721", `ref_doc_id`: "d590ce85-850e-48eb-91bc-2409b9930721", `source_type`: "google_drive", `title`: "Onboarding/2. Setup"});
