 0.026611328125, -0.005786895751953125, -0.0228424072265625, 0.06439208984375, 0.0191497802734375, 0.05401611328125, 0.0079498291015625, 0.0138397216796875, -0.0106048583984375, -0.00641632080078125, -0.0214385986328125, -0.05084228515625, 0.034820556640625, -0.0222015380859375, -0.0203704833984375, -0.0057220458984375, 0.01148223876953125, 0.0275115966796875, 0.041778564453125, -0.072509765625, -0.026123046875, -0.0127105712890625, 0.058013916015625, -0.01470184326171875, -0.039306640625, 0.07666015625, -0.029449462890625, 0.01248931884765625, -0.005229949951171875, -0.01438140869140625, 0.02667236328125, -0.03277587890625, -0.032135009765625, -0.00426483154296875, -0.031402587890625, 0.04046630859375, -0.0271148681640625, 0.02728271484375, -0.022705078125, 0.01250457763671875, -0.00467681884765625, -0.04296875, 0.0020580291748046875, -0.0218505859375, -0.028778076171875, -0.02862548828125, 0.00020921230316162109, -0.007068634033203125, 0.01031494140625, -0.0088348388671875, 0.0948486328125, 0.033599853515625, 0.0204925537109375, 0.0055389404296875, 0.0330810546875, -0.00218963623046875, -0.0181427001953125, -0.036773681640625, -0.0516357421875, 0.005840301513671875], `id`: 31, `name`: "Laravel Multi-tenancy Architecture", `summary`: "This community focuses on the implementation of multi-tenancy in a Laravel project, specifically using a multi-database approach with subdomain-based tenant identification. Key concepts include route separation between api.php and tenant.php, database architecture (central vs tenant databases), and migration management for tenant-specific data. The grouping serves to illustrate the technical implementation of isolated tenant environments while maintaining shared central functionality. Distinctive characteristics include the use of dedicated route files, database connection management, and the handling of queue jobs in the central database."});
